WEBVTT

00:00:03.203 --> 00:00:07.893
Entries stay in the list so that you can look back at what was imported.

00:00:07.893 --> 00:00:12.884
When you no longer need one, choose Delete from its Actions menu and confirm.

00:00:12.884 --> 00:00:18.415
That removes the entry and its uploaded file, but never the content that was imported.

00:00:18.415 --> 00:00:22.263
You can also tick several entries and remove them at once.

